 "remarks": "Welcome to Piper, Norwalk's newest luxury community. This new-construction two-story townhouse offers 2 bedrooms, a den, and 3 baths, with direct garage access as well as a private terrace that opens directly into the landscaped promenade. The open first floor features a kitchen with quartz counters, tile backsplash, stainless appliances, and large windows. Upstairs, the bedrooms offer generous closets, and the baths. A den on the upper floor provides additional space. In-unit washer/dryer, keyless entry, and smart thermostat included. Amenities include: resort-style pool, firepits and grills, rooftop deck, fitness center and studio, wine room, resident lounges, on-site co-working spaces, pet spa, and indoor pet play area. Next door to restaurants and coffee shops, and minutes to SoNo dining and nightlife, the Maritime Aquarium, Wall Street Theater, Norwalk Art Space, and Mathews Park. Metro-North and I-95 nearby for Stamford, New Haven, and NYC; close to Westport, New Canaan, and Fairfield. A great fit if you are looking to experience Coastal Connecticut, relocating, between homes, or renovating.",
